e obtained by playing or standing AFK while others have fun.<br>But fear not, we also sell pointless cosmetic items , so you can look <strong>fabulooooous</strong>!<br><br><strong>Note</strong>: All cosmetics are <strong>100%</strong> ethical and support starving devs in the north.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/911380/extras/0d2afae02189b877ad384e1fe4b878e9.poster.avif?t=1567936588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/911380/extras/0d2afae02189b877ad384e1fe4b878e9.webm?t=1567936588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/911380/extras/0d2afae02189b877ad384e1fe4b878e9.mp4?t=1567936588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SUPERDUPER AWESOME, WHEN CAN I PLAY IT?</strong></h2>When we get enough people to <strong>WISHLIST</strong> us and join our <strong>DISCORD</strong>!<br>Here are some excellent reasons why <strong>YOU</strong> should do it! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/911380/extras/gif1.png?t=1567936588\" /></div>",
